---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy | Remote Team Partners"
  description="How Remote Team Partners uses cookies and similar technologies, and how you can control them."
  path="/cookies/"
  base="../"
>
  <section class="hero hero-slim">
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="../">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span>
        <span class="cur">Cookie Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <div class="sec-head left">
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Legal</span>
        <h1>Cookie Policy.</h1>
        <p>Last updated: October 2026. A short, honest note about the cookies on this site.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" style="padding-bottom:88px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="legal-card">
        <h2>1. What cookies are</h2>
        <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device by your browser. They help websites remember preferences and understand how visitors use the site.</p>

        <h2>2. Cookies we use</h2>
        <p>This site is intentionally light on tracking:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Strictly necessary:</strong> basic functions like remembering your menu state and security. These cannot be switched off.</li>
          <li><strong>Preferences:</strong> remembering choices you make on the site, if any.</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics (only if enabled):</strong> if we add analytics in the future, it will measure aggregate visits so we can improve the site. We will list the provider here when that happens.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not use advertising or cross-site tracking cookies.</p>

        <h2>3. Managing cookies</h2>
        <p>You can block or delete cookies at any time in your browser settings. Blocking strictly necessary cookies may affect how the site works. Guidance for popular browsers is available on their support pages.</p>

        <h2>4. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>If our use of cookies changes, we will update this page and the last-updated date above.</p>

        <h2>5. Contact</h2>
        <p>Cookie questions: <a href="mailto:hello@remoteteampartners.com">hello@remoteteampartners.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
